### Component 4: WebSocket Integration (Simplified)

WebSocket client infrastructure for real-time price streaming. Following YAGNI, we'll create the structure but with stubbed/mock implementations for now.

#### [NEW] [ExchangeWebSocketClient.java](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/websocket/ExchangeWebSocketClient.java)

Abstract base class/interface:
- Methods: `connect()`, `disconnect()`, `subscribe(CurrencyPair pair)`, `onMessage(Consumer<PriceTick> handler)`
- Lifecycle management

#### [NEW] [BinanceWebSocketClient.java](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/main/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/websocket/impl/BinanceWebSocketClient.java)

Binance WebSocket implementation:
- **Manual implementation first**: Use Java WebSocket API (`javax.websocket`) to demonstrate the pain points
