All tests will be run with Maven:

```bash
# Run all tests
cd /home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator
./mvnw clean test
```

#### 1. Arbitrage Domain & Repository Tests

**New Test File**: `ArbitrageOpportunityTest.java`
- Test: Valid arbitrage opportunity creation
- Test: Validation - bid must be less than ask
- Test: Validation - profit percentage must be positive
- Test: Validation - all fields non-null

**New Test File**: `ArbitrageRepositoryTest.java` (extends [BaseIntegrationTest](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/test/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/BaseIntegrationTest.java#25-62))
