- Test: Calculate correct profit percentage

**New Test File**: `ArbitrageServiceIntegrationTest.java` (extends [BaseIntegrationTest](file:///home/pranay/anotherDrive/javaCodes/crypto-price-aggregator/src/test/java/com/cryptoArb/crypto_price_aggregator/BaseIntegrationTest.java#25-62))
